WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:00,960
Then I want to go too

2
00:00:01,400 --> 00:00:02,600
I want to do what I like

3
00:00:02,800 --> 00:00:05,200
See the outside world and make friends

4
00:00:05,560 --> 00:00:06,960
Be a free eagle

5
00:00:07,540 --> 00:00:10,540
Mom, let's go out, of course.

6
00:00:11,610 --> 00:00:12,810
I am your son Xiaoqiang

7
00:00:12,810 --> 00:00:16,210
If you want to go, go, go, go

8
00:00:16,250 --> 00:00:17,810
There will be time later

9
00:00:17,970 --> 00:00:19,210
Go home and see

10
00:00:19,330 --> 00:00:39,960
What time is it now? It's almost twelve o'clock.

11
00:00:41,070 --> 00:00:43,180
Brother, you have to wait for me
